---
// src/pages/contact.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Contact & Support"
  description="Get in touch with FileBrik team for support, feature inquiries, or bug reports."
>
  <main class="legal-wrap">
    <div class="fb-container fb-container-narrow">
      <article class="fb-card legal-card">
        <h1>Contact FileBrik</h1>
        <p>Have questions about client-side document processing, feature recommendations, or exam portal preset updates?</p>

        <h2>Support Inquiries</h2>
        <p>Public tracker: <a href="https://github.com/pravesh62689/filebrik-site/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/pravesh62689/filebrik-site/issues</a></p>
        <p>Our engineering team reviews bug reports and preset update requests within 24-48 business hours.</p>

        <h2>Privacy & Legal</h2>
        <p>For data inquiries or architecture verification, review our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Architecture</a> or file a ticket on GitHub.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-wrap { padding: 4rem 0; }
  .legal-card { padding: 3rem; }
  .legal-card h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .legal-card h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--fb-border); padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .legal-card p { font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
</style>
